// NOT NEEDED ANY MORE. The demo pages load /config.js, which the API builds from .env:
//   SARVAM_EMBED_KEY=<embed-scoped key from indus.sarvam.ai -> Deploy with code -> API keys (never the server key)>
//   SARVAM_ORG_ID / SARVAM_WORKSPACE_ID / SARVAM_APP_ID (buyer agent) / SARVAM_APP_ID_SELLER (seller agent)  (optional, defaults in app/api.py)
// A real web/config.js would be shadowed by the API route anyway and is still git-ignored.
